        25,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://lakeisabellami.org/your_community/community_history/index.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s charter was drafted by the Lake Isabella Charter Commission, whose members included Elmer Ledbetter, Jack Adkins, and Chair Gerald Gaudette.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://lakeisabellami.org/your_community/community_history/index.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Isabella began as an ambitious real‑estate development in the late 1960s, envisioned by Golden Grigg, Nephi Grigg, and Leo Gatehouse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://lakeisabellami.org/your_community/community_history/index.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Geographically, the village sits between Broomfield Township to the south and Sherman Township to the north.",
